    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alaá muruuwí sleémeero oo inkihhimuú waawutmo Hesekia, waawutmo Senakeribu oo múk Ashuru yaamaá Yuda gina i haratláy. Iri tláy xafay gway tleéhh didár gixsadá' koo/i gawit, ngiwa xui yaamu gi kós tleehh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár waawutmo Hesekia ngiwa ár waawutmo Senakeribu naa hardáh as gixsár Yerusalemu ngiwa i haratlay, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inós nee geeraharuuse nee miguusér slaqwara nina al'axweesiyé', yau kudaá tsee/aá gixsa kiwa tseegi, inooín nguri ale/iisiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk yaariír kuri burumbuúr dinkwárí ale as yau sleémeero kiwa tseegi nee yauudá' naa baraá tla/angwdár waaraahhiye', tawa kaahi, «Ahaá, gár waawituú Ashuru birna hardáh ma'aá yaariir ngis slay?» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Hesekia koo/ír gixsadá' gari iisluúk, nee /aampu giri tleéhh. Guruú tsee/aawo koo/ír tsár gari tleéhh, nee didá' ta bay Milo gari ló'wa gawdeés baraá gixsár Daudiwo. Inós sleeme xooslaá slaqwara nee gaambaá yaariir giri tleéhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muu sleémeero baraá gixsaro guri burumbuúr dír tseetsee/amtá afkú gixsa. Geeraharusmoó slaqwaruuse guri xuumusmooín wa qaás, muu guri i axweés tawa mune hhe'eesi, giri báy, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Ilakaahareesé', mune hhe'eesé', ma da'ayuumitaara', nee ma amooqwaqwadimara' dír geeraá waawutmoó Ashuruwo, laqaá dír slaqwaruuseerós sleémeero, asma kuduú dinkwa nee atén ku úr ta kuduú dinkwa nee Senakeribu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós /uuruú hee kilós gun kón, ala atén AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúrén, u koomaán, atén ti alee/iis, slamí tin aleeslaaqw.» /Aymi'iikaá waawutmo Hesekia muu nguna /uurií doogiyé'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alaá tihe waawutmo Senakeribu oo Ashuru, qoomár gixsár Lakishi ngiwa haraweel, sagadiyuuse gari ya/aáw Yerusalemu amór waawutmo Hesekia oo Yuda, nee dír muu sleémeero oo Yuda, kudá' baraá Yerusalemúrií dirií', tawa kaahi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Waawutmo Senakeribu oo Ashuru i kaahi, ‹Xáy gár taa harahhifé' a milá baraá gixsár Yerusalemu tí ta harweeri? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xáy, adoorihe Hesekia kuungá' nun tsu/utár wa slaiikáhe ar qwari nee waxe, nuwa babay, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng nu ba/amis dír waawutmoó Ashuruwo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xáy, Hesekiadá' a kwiheekáhe oo wa/ameedár gawaá gongoama' Mungú kuwa sluufmiisi nee kiteeriwose gaa hingees, múk Yuda nee oo Yerusalemu guri báy, dír kitángw wák na wa sluufmisaak nee ilahhooarhúng ar muruú ta tsu/i ka gawaadií da/a/aandá'? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xáy, a xua'aakáhe tidá' aníng nee baabi'iieene naa tleehhaán dír xoordu sleémeero awa ayeemaá hatlá'? Xáy, munguiidaá xoordaá ayeemoodá' sleémeero múk ayeemooín ngwaa aleeslayí'i tu/uto gawaá dabaaeene? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xáy, baraá munguiidaá xoordaá hatlá' sleémeero, kudá' baabi'iieé' naa ló'wa hhaamisiyé', munguú mukós gwaa aleesláy ba/amisaro gawaá dabaaeene i deéro? Daqaní doóqa Munguúhúng kuungá' nu aleesláy ba/amisaro gawaá dabaaeene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe Hesekia mu aleeya/aa/amaara' nuwa al/agin, nee nuwa qwaareemisi ar axweesanaysíng, sleeme mu haratlintatiaara'. Asma mungú tumu xooro gaalá, laqaá tumu waawuti'iima gaalahe, oo mukós gwaa aleeslay ba/amisaro i kaahh gawaá dabaaeene, nee gawaá dabaá baabi'iieene. Ala an qo Munguúhúng kwisinge oo kuungá' nu ba/amís gawaá dabaaeene!› »",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeraharuusér waawutmoó Ashuru /ayma'aá hatlá' tlakw kiri aaín daanduú AAKOÓ MUNGUHE, nee daanduú waawutmo Hesekiawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmoó Ashuru sleeme barwito'o gana gooín ar AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú Israeli, nguwa /oosliislín iwa kaahi, «Adoodá' munguaá xoordaá hatlá' muk'ín ngura harslaaqatiyé' ba/amisaro gawaá dabaeene, an adór Munguú Hesekia mukós ba/amisaro ngur aleeslayká gawaá dabaaeene.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sagadiyuuseedá' ina axwés ar tsifrír Ebrania nee ar tseeo dír múk Israeli, kuduú gawaá sagér koo/i, asma inooín nina tsabiné' kiwa dae tsati nee kiwa amoqwaareesi, as gixsa kawa adór inslaahhár hayoohi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín tari axweés daanduú Munguú Yerusalemuwo kwaáo an adór munguaá xoordaá hatlá', awa taa tleéhh ar dabaá muu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Hesekia nee aarusmo Isaya garmoó Amosi, Mungú nguna firiné' nee nguna i /aa/iyé' as ngiwa alee/iisi daanduú muruuwí sleémeerowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ malaykamoowós guri ya/aáw, slaqwaruuseedár miguuse ar waawutmo Senakeribu, nee geeraharuuseero giri tsuú/, kudá' baraá xafáy diriiá'. Waawutmo iri waátl ayaawós i alé ar mure. Qoomár iwa dáh baraá doó munguúwós, kuri gaás nee daaqaywós oo kilá' ar paánga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy AAKOÓ MUNGÚ waawutmo Hesekia guri ba/amís, nee yaamuloouusér Yerusalemu sleémeero, gawaá dabaá waawutmo Senakeribu oo Ashuru wa ale, nee gawaá dabaá wakuuser'ín sleémeerowo. Múk Yuda wayda gway ar hoót deelo sleémeerowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk yaariír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngway sluufáy huúw baraá Yerusalemu, tam sleeme qeemuú yaariír kway huúw dír waawutmo Hesekia. Iimír qoomaadae waawutmo Hesekia kuri ló'wa xirfayeemiís nee xoordaá hatlá' sleémeero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomaarihe Hesekia tiqti guri ót tsaxwaá iwa lak gwaai. AAKOÓ MUNGÚ guri firín, Mungú firoorós gay mu/aywaáts ar laya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Hesekia AAKOÓ MUNGÚ gwa sluufáy hanisiiká daanduú tí sleémeerowo, asma muunaáwós ina haáts daara/aango. AAKOÓ MUNGÚ inós guri i buúhh, nee múk Yudawo, nee múk Yerusalemúr hoota. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo waawutmo Hesekia tiri niinaweés, inós nee múk Yerusalemuro, daara/aangós kudá' gway máy. Gawaá adoorihe AAKOÓ MUNGÚ inooín gaa malé i buhhiiká deeloodá' sleémeero ar Hesekia iwa slafi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
