          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Hesekia iri daqaari'iít, umuú heewo guri ilaiwawaá/. Inós daqaari'iimár peésa gana tleéhh, nee sahaábu, nee tlaa/aá tlaxo gawden, nee tlaa/aá hatlae, nee muruú ta muruú /aymaárár tsuu'umiisi, nee gaambu, nee xooslaá hatlá' awa tlaxo gawden. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sleeme inós maraá kuntoó balaangw kway babaatsi gay tleéhh, nee wa/ángw difaái nee di/ito kay batsi gay tleéhh. Slumaá hikwa nee awa bee/aango gay tleéhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sleeme gixsaduuwós giri tleéhh, inós hikwaá yaariir nee bee/aango gina sláy, asma Mungú inós guna tsuúq, guri daqaari'iimár yaariír i haniís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Hesekia yaaér Gihoni gana tseék, mapari gari foól ar ma'aay ngir baráy wa/asi ay gixsár Daudi. Hesekia umuú gár aa tleehhi gana aleesláy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Babuloni nguwa yaahaasár áy daanduú muruuduú waa/oo/amo aa tlehhiít baraá yaamuuwose, Mungú waawutmo Hesekia guna tawo máy, adoodá' inós i tleehhamór wa slai gay tleéhh, adoorí ina tleehharút as inós kuwa iiari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
