        },
        {
          "text": "Tlehhma'aá waawutmo Hesekia kudá' naa meetiye' kaa gooín baraá kitaábuú Iigu'utuú aarusmo Isaya garmoó Amosi, nee baraá kitaábuú waawituú Yuda nee oo Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
